Package: scorewright
Type: Package
Title: SME Credit Scorecard Development, Validation & Monitoring Studio
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person(given = "Arpon",
            family = "Biswas",
            role = c("aut", "cre"),
            email = "entityerror3@gmail.com")
Description: An interactive Shiny application implementing the standard
    credit scorecard development pipeline: exploratory analysis, WOE/IV
    coarse classing, points-to-score scaling of a logistic regression
    model, discrimination and calibration validation, drift monitoring
    via PSI/CSI, and cutoff strategy analysis. Methodology follows
    Siddiqi (2006, Credit Risk Scorecards) and Thomas, Edelman & Crook
    (2017, Credit Scoring and Its Applications).
License: MIT + file LICENSE.md
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
URL: https://github.com/arponbiswasanik/scorewright
BugReports: https://github.com/arponbiswasanik/scorewright/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Imports: 
    bslib,
    DT,
    stats
